+The native suite compiles with MSVC `/W4 /WX`, and optionally AddressSanitizer. `Tools/TestCore.ps1 -MovementOnly` runs the isolated locomotion contract even when an unrelated combat regression blocks the full suite. Movement coverage includes acceleration, directional caps, diagonal normalization, stopping distance, reversal response, sprint transitions, combat-state movement, bounded release drive and frame-rate consistency.
